    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一个动作，你可以挥舞这张卡片并用其施放<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.new-icon.Item.VC9nFuUxF7yptXK5]{敲击术knock}</em>，以此法施放的法术不会发出敲击声。你能使用该特性五次，每天黎明时，它重获所有已被消耗的使用次数。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card and use it to cast the @spell[Knock] spell, with no sound made by the spell. This property can be used five times, and it regains all expended uses at dawn.</p></div>",
